Package: nesstarR
Type: Package
Title: Read and Export 'NESSTAR' Binary Containers
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Saket", "Choudhary", email = "saketkc@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Reads '.Nesstar' binary containers produced by the 'NESSTAR'
    Publisher software and distributed by statistical agencies such as the
    Ministry of Statistics and Programme Implementation (MoSPI), India.
    Decodes packed numeric and fixed-width string columns into data frames,
    recovers embedded variable labels and category codes, and exports
    datasets to CSV in memory-bounded chunks.
